<title>USA: McWhorter 1996 results met expectations.</title>
<headline>McWhorter 1996 results met expectations.</headline>
<dateline>CARPENTERSVILLE, Ill. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>McWhorter Technologies Inc, a manufacturer of resins used in the paint and coatings industry, said its results for fiscal 1996 ended October 31 met its expectations.</p>
<p>&quot;Results for 1996 were in line with expectations,&quot; said president John Stevenson in a statement. &quot;Volume improved significantly during the second half and we are cautiously optimistic about continued volume growth in 1997.&quot;</p>
<p>For the fourth quarter, the company reported earnings of $0.40 per share, up from $0.29. Sales advanced to $86.6 million from $82 million.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
